  "display_title": "I Seduced the Cheating Duke",
  "description": "Maria fulfills her duties as a guild member while hiding her identity as a fallen count's daughter to make a living.\nOne day, she receives a request from her to break up the wedding of the Duke of Berry Winter.\n\n*\"This marriage is invalid! I... have the Duke's child!\"*\n\nAt Maria's shocking declaration, the wedding hall became agitated and she was just about to leave,\n\n*\"Baby, why are you so late?\"*\n\nThe Duke of Berry Winter calls me that during our first meeting...?\n\nWill Maria, who has suddenly become the duke's wife, be able to fulfill her wealthy dream?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
